WEBVTT

00:00:01.381 --> 00:00:13.259
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:18.956
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.999 --> 00:00:25.905
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:37.442
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:43.556
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:50.962
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:58.772
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.772 --> 00:01:05.645
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:11.251
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.251 --> 00:01:17.524
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.524 --> 00:01:25.954
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:32.539 --> 00:01:36.202
That guy. He knows me.

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:39.240
The me that I don't know.

00:01:46.953 --> 00:01:48.545
Demian.

00:01:54.795 --> 00:01:56.797
Big Sister.

00:01:56.797 --> 00:02:00.233
Very soon, I'll be able to
hear your real voice.

00:02:01.435 --> 00:02:04.893
The voice that I have even
heard in my dreams.

00:02:06.306 --> 00:02:09.342
At last I can return to Greecia!

00:02:09.342 --> 00:02:11.812
Don't be shocked, Titus.

00:02:11.812 --> 00:02:16.374
I'm going to resurrect Tina and
take Greecia into my own hands!

00:02:37.838 --> 00:02:42.798
INCOMING

00:02:46.246 --> 00:02:47.914
It's started moving!

00:02:47.914 --> 00:02:50.246
We have to get out through
a ventilation opening quickly!

00:02:52.853 --> 00:02:54.411
There's a light!

00:03:03.096 --> 00:03:05.087
It's huge!

00:03:11.304 --> 00:03:13.329
Chitto!

00:03:20.247 --> 00:03:23.114
-Are you okay, Chitto?
-Y-Yeah...

00:03:25.685 --> 00:03:28.017
Wonder!

00:03:31.057 --> 00:03:34.160
It's considerably larger
than the last machine.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:37.063
This is the size that was designed
in order to make possible

00:03:37.063 --> 00:03:40.396
a comprehensive navigation of the
Ged dimension, the world of death.

00:03:41.601 --> 00:03:45.332
But there are a lot of mysteries
about this project.

00:03:45.939 --> 00:03:47.374
As usual, the questions regarding

00:03:47.374 --> 00:03:50.343
that piece of stone called the
Fragment remain unanswered.

00:03:51.278 --> 00:03:55.181
Who could have left behind the
plans for this kind of a machine?

00:03:55.181 --> 00:04:00.016
Have you never asked Professor
Gherta's opinion regarding that matter?

00:04:00.387 --> 00:04:01.755
Oh, that?

00:04:01.755 --> 00:04:04.925
She thinks it's some kind of information
from extraterrestrial life-forms,

00:04:04.925 --> 00:04:07.723
or maybe a legacy of ancient man.

00:04:08.862 --> 00:04:11.331
As it turned out, even though
she doesn't actually know,

00:04:11.331 --> 00:04:13.561
things have still progressed this far.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.905
The reason we had the last test
was to gauge her credibility.

00:04:18.905 --> 00:04:22.534
And the results proved that the
Ged dimension does in fact exist.

00:04:22.742 --> 00:04:26.680
Well, at any rate, we're inviting
people from prominent nations.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:28.582
Failure will not be tolerated.

00:04:28.582 --> 00:04:30.917
By the way, what about those
pilots the Royal Security Agency

00:04:30.917 --> 00:04:32.908
is supposed to be providing for us?

00:04:33.787 --> 00:04:36.056
That Demian from the
Royal Security Agency,

00:04:36.056 --> 00:04:38.923
rumor has it that
apparently he doesn't age.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:42.796
So that's another mystery then.

00:04:42.796 --> 00:04:45.065
The pilots that Demian
was talking about,

00:04:45.065 --> 00:04:47.534
are they really prepared for this?

00:04:47.534 --> 00:04:50.870
I was told that they're people that
Demian arranged for personally, but...

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.168
They should be arriving soon.

00:04:54.808 --> 00:04:58.767
And it looks like they're starting to
pump fuel into the Ged Ring as well.

00:05:16.963 --> 00:05:18.999
Damn it! In a place this big,

00:05:18.999 --> 00:05:21.593
there's no way you can figure
out where you're going!

00:05:21.968 --> 00:05:23.959
Thoma!

00:05:24.971 --> 00:05:26.734
Be careful, Wonder!

00:05:34.948 --> 00:05:36.716
Thoma! Chitto!

00:05:36.716 --> 00:05:38.308
Ou... Ouch...

00:05:39.419 --> 00:05:41.319
That stupid thing...

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:45.753
Run, Chitto!

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:58.528
Let's go, Chitto!

00:06:00.173 --> 00:06:01.970
This way!

00:06:05.912 --> 00:06:07.709
They're here!

00:06:22.762 --> 00:06:24.992
Look! What is that thing?

00:06:28.935 --> 00:06:30.562
Come on, Alice!

00:06:36.342 --> 00:06:39.813
That man... Isn't he the
British Secretary of Defense?

00:06:39.813 --> 00:06:42.043
I've seen him on television.

00:06:42.248 --> 00:06:43.943
Cooks!

00:06:46.553 --> 00:06:49.389
Those are prominent members of
the American and Chinese military.

00:06:49.389 --> 00:06:51.291
What are they planning on doing?

00:06:51.291 --> 00:06:53.359
A top secret presentation.

00:06:53.359 --> 00:06:55.528
The Ged Group, which
started with the Fragment,

00:06:55.528 --> 00:06:57.120
is demonstrating their experiment.

00:06:58.598 --> 00:07:01.931
This is such a big place, I'm sure
we can get in from somewhere.

00:07:02.535 --> 00:07:04.571
Energy infusion, sixty percent.

00:07:04.571 --> 00:07:06.539
How is the weather over Kuril island?

00:07:06.539 --> 00:07:09.542
A typhoon is developing in the
southeastern part of the Akaba Sea,

00:07:09.542 --> 00:07:11.644
but it won't reach here until
the day after tomorrow.

00:07:11.644 --> 00:07:14.247
More importantly, I detected an
earthquake a little while ago.

00:07:14.247 --> 00:07:15.248
An earthquake?

00:07:15.248 --> 00:07:18.217
1000 kilometers off the coast of the
Raul Islands, on the ocean floor.

00:07:20.153 --> 00:07:22.489
Demian still hasn't arrived yet?

00:07:22.489 --> 00:07:24.787
And what about those pilots we need?

00:07:24.991 --> 00:07:28.194
The invited guests from the other
countries are already gathered here,

00:07:28.194 --> 00:07:30.864
but nothing's going to happen if
no one is here to pilot the thing!

00:07:30.864 --> 00:07:33.266
Go and get Professor Gherta!

00:07:33.266 --> 00:07:34.631
Yes, sir!

00:07:35.435 --> 00:07:37.960
Well, we really have
nothing to worry about.

00:07:38.104 --> 00:07:41.369
The GED Ring navigation
will take place as planned.

00:07:41.841 --> 00:07:45.971
The pilots we prepared
are already standing by.

00:07:58.958 --> 00:08:01.620
You can't run away from me.

00:08:02.328 --> 00:08:05.229
It excites the blood of one who's been
a scientist for such a long time.

00:08:06.099 --> 00:08:08.168
I'll tell you one thing.

00:08:08.168 --> 00:08:12.070
It's you who is one of them.

00:08:14.507 --> 00:08:19.570
He knows me.
The me that I don't know.

00:08:19.913 --> 00:08:23.144
Everything began with this Fragment.

00:08:23.383 --> 00:08:24.751
Inside of this...

00:08:24.751 --> 00:08:27.515
It's inside of that, isn't it,
Professor Gherta?

00:08:34.327 --> 00:08:36.429
What have you come
to do at this point?

00:08:36.429 --> 00:08:38.665
The machine has already
been completed.

00:08:38.665 --> 00:08:40.667
Greecians.

00:08:40.667 --> 00:08:42.468
I thought I warned you.

00:08:42.468 --> 00:08:45.869
If you don't put a stop to this,
we will stop it.

00:08:52.212 --> 00:08:54.009
Are you going to destroy it?

00:09:09.495 --> 00:09:11.122
As we thought.

00:09:13.233 --> 00:09:16.100
This is the Fragment?

00:09:16.369 --> 00:09:19.827
All of that code was inside of this?

00:09:24.477 --> 00:09:26.570
A piece of the Out Zone.

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:29.380
A part of our transference device.

00:09:29.816 --> 00:09:32.944
You people had...
a transference device?

00:09:44.497 --> 00:09:48.268
It's useless. Those pieces will oxidize
and disappear in a matter of minutes.

00:09:48.268 --> 00:09:50.759
That's what should have
originally happened, anyway.

00:09:51.604 --> 00:09:53.333
Let's go, Soreto!

00:10:08.221 --> 00:10:10.212
It looks similar to...

00:10:13.893 --> 00:10:17.124
As I thought. They look similar.

00:10:20.066 --> 00:10:22.899
The black stone that
Conrad Rugen had.

00:10:24.437 --> 00:10:28.203
Is there a code inside of this?

00:11:36.743 --> 00:11:38.608
It's surfacing!

00:11:42.281 --> 00:11:43.942
Is it going to leave the ocean?

00:13:32.492 --> 00:13:35.962
This place is too big, we have
no idea where to look.

00:13:35.962 --> 00:13:38.898
Tarlant! Can you use Wonder
to break the window?

00:13:38.898 --> 00:13:42.101
There's no way! It'd be faster to
go back to that ventilation vent!

00:13:42.101 --> 00:13:45.161
Before it gains altitude, we should
check things out from the outside.

00:14:02.188 --> 00:14:04.520
That's strange! I can't see the exit!

00:14:07.727 --> 00:14:09.862
Something is different from before!

00:14:09.862 --> 00:14:12.092
But this should be the same passage.

00:14:27.647 --> 00:14:29.137
Tina...

00:14:30.316 --> 00:14:32.307
Seth...

00:14:32.952 --> 00:14:34.943
Soran...

00:15:00.046 --> 00:15:02.480
I can see something!

00:15:10.323 --> 00:15:12.558
It's no good! We can't get out!

00:15:12.558 --> 00:15:14.958
Damn it! Where's the exit?!

00:15:18.931 --> 00:15:21.092
Can we get out?

00:15:32.011 --> 00:15:35.174
If we knew where the lock was,
Wonder could open it for us.

00:15:58.471 --> 00:16:01.107
What is that? I can see something.

00:16:01.107 --> 00:16:03.769
It's huge. Could it be a cloud?

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:13.753
We can't wait for Demian any longer!

00:16:13.753 --> 00:16:17.957
You! Go ahead with the preparation
of the substitute pilots!

00:16:17.957 --> 00:16:21.552
They're already standing by
at the boarding gate.

00:16:21.694 --> 00:16:25.721
The inaugural run of the Ged Ring
will be starting very soon.

00:17:02.368 --> 00:17:04.461
-It's started moving.
-Let's hurry.

00:17:04.637 --> 00:17:07.707
With a device this size, it will
take time to open the Zone.

00:17:07.707 --> 00:17:10.609
Soreto, interrupt the rotation
of the second ring.

00:17:10.609 --> 00:17:11.977
I'll stop the one on the outside.

00:17:11.977 --> 00:17:13.501
Understood!

00:17:30.629 --> 00:17:32.927
W-What is this?!

00:17:51.851 --> 00:17:53.452
Unbelievable...

00:17:53.452 --> 00:17:54.553
What's going on?!

00:17:54.553 --> 00:17:57.681
Robots came falling out of the sky.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:34.288
These are your bodies?

00:18:35.928 --> 00:18:38.488
Gueroca stole them.

00:18:38.964 --> 00:18:40.795
How could this happen?

00:18:41.333 --> 00:18:43.536
Even though we waited for so long,

00:18:43.536 --> 00:18:46.272
there were never any
messages from Greecia.

00:18:46.272 --> 00:18:48.240
This is the reason why.

00:18:56.282 --> 00:18:57.909
That's why I told you...

00:18:59.718 --> 00:19:04.621
I could drive a stake into
your hearts at any time.

00:19:05.024 --> 00:19:06.492
I've been waiting.

00:19:06.492 --> 00:19:09.518
You! Give Helga back!

00:19:16.869 --> 00:19:19.438
Helga is my older sister.

00:19:19.438 --> 00:19:21.574
You have no say in the matter.

00:19:21.574 --> 00:19:24.236
What do you intend
to do with our bodies?

00:19:25.544 --> 00:19:30.311
Out of the seven here, there are
already two of you working for me.

00:19:34.019 --> 00:19:35.816
Hesma.

00:19:39.925 --> 00:19:42.393
-You!
-Hesma!

00:19:42.761 --> 00:19:44.363
You betrayed us, Hesma!

00:19:44.363 --> 00:19:46.524
Tarlant, Hasmodye.

00:19:46.866 --> 00:19:49.168
I want to go back to Greecia
no matter what.

00:19:49.168 --> 00:19:52.071
Thinking of that is the only thing
that's gotten me this far.

00:19:52.071 --> 00:19:53.772
All this time, not even once,

00:19:53.772 --> 00:19:56.408
have I allowed myself to get
close to the humans of Earth.

00:19:56.408 --> 00:19:58.544
I'm proud of that!

00:19:58.544 --> 00:20:02.615
We are Greecians! Let's cooperate
with Dumas and go home to Greecia.

00:20:02.615 --> 00:20:03.682
Cooperate?

00:20:03.682 --> 00:20:05.351
By making improvements
to the control mechanism.

00:20:05.351 --> 00:20:07.386
You're going to help him revive Tina?!

00:20:07.386 --> 00:20:10.822
Do you intend to make that
same mistake all over again? Hesma!

00:20:11.757 --> 00:20:14.560
Make the same mistake again?

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:16.228
You monsters!

00:20:16.228 --> 00:20:18.998
You turned my older sister
into a weapon!

00:20:18.998 --> 00:20:21.800
I've always hated all of you.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:24.598
Do you people understand
my suffering?!

00:20:25.604 --> 00:20:29.508
All the more reason we can't
cooperate with reviving Tina.

00:20:29.508 --> 00:20:32.909
You said there were two of us.
Who is the other person?!

00:20:33.512 --> 00:20:35.343
I think you called her "Mel."

00:20:35.681 --> 00:20:38.517
Mel?! Mel can't possibly be here!

00:20:38.517 --> 00:20:41.714
Mel lived more than
a hundred years ago!

00:20:44.156 --> 00:20:46.351
It's Professor Gherta.

00:20:48.594 --> 00:20:51.961
Professor Gherta is the
reincarnation of Mel.

00:21:17.523 --> 00:21:19.354
From that time...

00:21:19.592 --> 00:21:22.928
It's the thing that was
drawn in Rugen's notes.

00:21:22.928 --> 00:21:24.987
What is this symbol?!

00:21:25.664 --> 00:21:26.999
I...

00:21:26.999 --> 00:21:28.330
Why...

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:31.267
Why did it cause such
a pain in my heart?

00:21:35.975 --> 00:21:37.710
I wonder if you remember.

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:41.480
111 years ago, I captured Mel

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:45.007
and tried to question her about
the transference device system.

00:21:46.819 --> 00:21:50.050
But she had already lost her memory.

00:21:50.222 --> 00:21:55.091
I didn't know that your memories
disappeared after a few years.

00:21:55.794 --> 00:21:58.854
So, I ended up putting her
through a terrible ordeal.

00:21:59.331 --> 00:22:01.200
Poor thing.

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:05.193
Even after being reincarnated
as Gherta, it stayed with her.

00:22:05.938 --> 00:22:07.769
You bastard!

00:22:12.611 --> 00:22:15.381
Everything will soon be over.

00:22:15.381 --> 00:22:17.781
Everything.

00:22:36.268 --> 00:22:46.041
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:46.311 --> 00:22:56.188
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:56.188 --> 00:23:00.926
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.926 --> 00:23:05.761
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:06.165 --> 00:23:15.335
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:15.441 --> 00:23:20.479
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:20.479 --> 00:23:25.751
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.751 --> 00:23:30.189
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:30.189 --> 00:23:34.493
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:34.493 --> 00:23:39.362
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
